    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You excel at moving through unseen geometries.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Jaunter through the angles species trait</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may activate the jaunter through the angles species trait as part of the swift action to designate twisted squares when using your non-Euclidean movement species trait.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Using jaunter through the angles is a swift action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/rhyzala#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
